FFmpeg
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Klip uses FFmpeg (libavcodec, libavfilter, libavformat, libavutil,
libswresample and libswscale) under the GNU Lesser General Public License
version 2.1 or later.

    https://ffmpeg.org/
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-2.1.html

FFmpeg is linked dynamically and is not modified or redistributed with Klip.
Klip requires an FFmpeg built without --enable-gpl: a GPL-configured libavcodec
would place any distributed Klip binary under the GPL.

